    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>By using QBank&#8217;s Connector to WordPress you gain access to all your files in QBank that you can<br />\npublish directly from WordPress without leaving their interface.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Search and filter media</li>\n<li>Edit media</li>\n<li>Uploading and publishing</li>\n<li>Responsive design and multi-sites</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/qbank-dam-connector</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>Use the Settings-&gt;QBank Connector to configure the plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added functionality for storing media in CDN</li>\n<li>Core: Minor fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Minor fixes and improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Upgrade of QBank 3 API PHP Wrapper</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Fix for report usage token</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Fixes for better Gutenberg support</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Fix for polyfill-mbstring/bootstrap.php</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Fix for polyfill-mbstring/bootstrap.php</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Fix add_submenu_page</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Gutenberg improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Gutenberg improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Core: Template selection</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
